'''''Aloo tama''''' ({{Langx|ne|आलू तामा}}) or '''''aloo bodi tama''''' ({{Langx|ne|आलू बोडी तामा}}) is a Nepali soup dish made of fermented bamboo shoots, potatoes and black-eyed peas.<ref>{{Cite web|date=2019-07-09|title=Where To Find The Best Himalayan Food In LA|url=https://laist.com/news/food/best-himalayan-food-in-la|access-date=2022-02-14|website=LAist|language=en}}</ref><ref>{{Cite web|date=2019-04-26|title=Love spicy food? Try exotic Nepali cuisine|url=https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/life-style/food-news/love-spicy-food-try-exotic-nepali-cuisine/photostory/69058845.cms|access-date=2022-02-14|website=The Times of India|language=en}}</ref>
